<title>FRANCE: Eramet 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Eramet 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     305  vs	     430</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		     6.60  vs	    6.60</p>
<p>    Pre-exceptional				460  vs	     581</p>
<p>    Cashflow					 651  vs	     686</p>
<p>    Turnover				     3,909  vs	   3,984</p>
<p>NOTE - Eramet gave the figures in a statement. The 1996 net profit figure includes 46 percent of the profits generated by Comilog, or 51 million francs after goodwill amortisation.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
